Package: igvfcatalogclient
Title: R Package Client for IGVF Catalog
Version: 1.3.0
Author: person("IGVF DACC", email = "encode-help@lists.stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: IGVF DACC <encode-help@lists.stanford.edu>
Description: IGVF Catalog OpenAPI compliant REST API built using tRPC with Express.  Our database uses 0-based, half-open coordinates for genomic coordinates in the GRCh38 (human) and GRCm39 (mouse) reference genomes.  Data is licensed under the <a href=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons license</a> and the software is licensed under the <a href=https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html target=\"_blank\">MIT license</a>.
URL: https://github.com/IGVF-DACC/igvf-catalog-r-client
BugReports: https://github.com/IGVF-DACC/igvf-catalog-r-client/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.3)
Encoding: UTF-8
License: MIT + file LICENSE
LazyData: true
Suggests: testthat
Imports: jsonlite, httr, R6, base64enc, stringr
RoxygenNote: 7.2.1
